\fs46 \cf2 For your convenience, this on-board tool may help give you more information about your specific tinnitus frequency range. Here you can access any of 90 precise sine-wave frequencies, allowing you to explore, preview and possibly pinpoint your specific ringing pitch frequency.\
\
NOTE: This is not meant to replace a proper diagnosis by a qualified medical professional, but it is provided for your exploration, experimentation, and understanding.
