I press PLAY, the button turns green, but i don\'92t hear any audio.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs46 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd7\expndtw37
All devices are different, and sometimes it can be a challenge to get audio to the right place. \
\
1) Stop the playback, and then start again.\
\
2) On the bottom of the screen, make sure the LED volume slider is up (showing green LEDs).\
\
3) Make sure your device\'92s physical volume is up (i.e., on the side edge of your device).\
\
4) It\'92s possible that your device\'92s audio output is pointing somewhere other than your desired playback speaker. i.e., to a different nearby bluetooth speaker or device.  To change this, stop playback and manage your output routing through your device\'92s settings pages.  Then restart the playback.\
\
5) When all else fails, quit the app and relaunch.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

